   "beat_id": "B02",
   "act": "Manim exhibit — Carnot cycle dual diagram",
   "narration_text": "Two isothermal processes, two adiabatic processes — the Carnot cycle traced on both diagrams at once. The area enclosed on the P-V diagram is the net work done per cycle. The area on the T-S diagram is the net heat exchanged. Both representations of the same cycle, same physics.",
